      "description": "Pause this Darwin agent. Pausing stops ALL trading for it \u2014 every order is refused. This API key keeps working for reads, so you can still see the agent's balances and orders. Only the owner can resume the agent, on Darwin; you cannot. Use it when your user asks you to stop, or if something seems wrong. Never counts against the transaction budget.",
